Post-run (runner.py 448-527): exit-code guard forces `outcome="error"` if nonzero; else `evaluate_outcome(sidecar, meta)` runs against the JSON emitted to `BTH_RESULTS_PATH` (or fallback paths, `_read_result_emission` 65-117). `outcome_is_residual` and `adversarial_check_status` (`"n/a"|"present"|"missing"`) are computed at 485-502. `parity_run_type` is extracted from doubly-nested `metadata.parity_run_type` at 504-513. Final `Run` is persisted via `write_run`.

